{
  "key": "letter-038-part-01",
  "number": 38,
  "generationId": "01a1e4ec-ec91-7723-959d-7504cc534cbd",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.766531
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I am glad to see such thirst for God!",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.105034,
      "end": 4.3443760000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "To have this thirst is a divine blessing; where there is thirst — there the way is.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.800816,
      "end": 10.672856999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "In fact, intense longing becomes the way.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/04.mp3",
      "start": 12.025261,
      "end": 14.89576
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "God is summoning us at every moment but because the strings of our heart are slack we don't echo his call.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/05.mp3",
      "start": 16.18551,
      "end": 21.012676000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "If our eyes are closed then even if the sun is at the door we will be in darkness; and the sun is always at the door - we only have to open our eyes and let it in, that's all!",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.488004999999998,
      "end": 32.148230999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "May God give you light, that's my wish.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/07.mp3",
      "start": 33.658912,
      "end": 36.186236
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "My love and I are always with you.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/08.mp3",
      "start": 37.670272000000004,
      "end": 40.503152
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Regards to the family and love to the children.",
      "path": "audio/1966-38/09.mp3",
      "start": 41.980748000000006,
      "end": 45.74
    }
  ]
}
